  <!-- EN: Post eye-catching and attractive artistic advertisements in various places in {0} to attract merchants from this town to come and settle in. This recruitment strategy requires art and knowledge.\n\nMost suitable person in your caravan is {1} who shall recruit merchants with a chance of {2} if in charge. -->
  <Kiiro.strategyOption_PostDesc>将富有张力与吸引力的艺术广告张贴在{0}各处以招揽这个村镇的商户前来入驻。选用这项招募策略需要艺术与智识。\n\n你的远行队里最合适的人选是{1}，由{1}来主导这次招募的话，成功招募到商户的概率大约为{2}。</Kiiro.strategyOption_PostDesc>
  <!-- EN: Visit specific merchants in {0} with gifts, and sincerely communicate and negotiate about settling in.This recruitment strategy requires negotiation skills.\n\nMost suitable person in your caravan is {1} who shall recruit merchants with a chance of {2} if in charge. -->
  <Kiiro.strategyOption_VisitDesc>带上见面礼物登门拜访{0}中特定的商户，情真意切地交流和磋商入驻事宜。选用这项招募策略需要谈判能力。\n\n你的远行队里最合适的人选是{1}，由{1}来主导这次招募的成功率大约为{2}。</Kiiro.strategyOption_VisitDesc>
  <!-- EN: Set up a temporary wooden stage in the town center of {0}, gather merchants for on-site recruitment speeches, and answer questions raised by merchants. This recruitment strategy requires social skills and knowledge.\n\nMost suitable person in your caravan is {1} who shall recruit merchants with a chance of {2} if in charge. -->
  <Kiiro.strategyOption_LectureDesc>在{0}的城镇中心搭起临时的木台，召集商户们进行现场招募宣讲并解答商户提出的疑问。选用这项招募策略需要社交与智识。\n\n你的远行队里最合适的人选是{1}，由{1}来主导这次招募的话，招募到至少一个商户的概率大约为{2}。</Kiiro.strategyOption_LectureDesc>
  
  <!-- EN: \n\nAs the person {0} in charge for this recruitment is Kiiro, chance to success is raised additionally by {1}. -->
  <Kiiro.strategyOption_ExtraDesc>\n\n由于此次主导招募的远行队成员{0}是绮罗族，本次招募的成功率额外提高了{1}。</Kiiro.strategyOption_ExtraDesc>



